DESCRIPTION:Conor Janda is a stand-up\, writer\, and actor. His writing exe
 mplifies both the neuroses of a New York transplant and the fiery spirit of
  a Philadelphia native. Conor can be seen on Netflix in Kevin Hart's Funny 
 AF\, on Don't Tell Comedy's channel\, and was recently named a New Face of 
 Comedy at the Just for Laughs Festival in Montreal. He has been featured as
  a writer and actor on the Gag\, Comedy Central’s queer digital channel.\
 n\nConor’s stand up covers everything from having a stay at home dad to g
